rder-radius:12px;border-width:1px;border-color:#e2e2dc"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#252525;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0"><span style="color:#5e5cdb"><strong>Capy Notebook</strong></span></p><h1 style="margin-left:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:12px;color:#252525;font-size:36px;line-height:40px;font-weight:800">账户删除已安排</h1><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#252525;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0">你好，</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;color:#252525;margin:0 0 20px 0;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:20px;margin-left:0">我们已收到你删除 Capy Notebook 账户的请求。删除将在 <!-- -->{{.GraceDays}}<!-- --> 天后执行。届时你的账户及其所有工作区、文件、资料和其他数据将被永久删除。如需取消，请在此之前联系支持。</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:100%;text-align:left;margin-bottom:20px"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><a href="{{.OpenURL}}" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;color:#ffffff;background-color:#5e5cdb;border-color:#5e5cdb;border-width:2px;border-style:solid;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 18px 12px 18px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:18px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:450%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">联系支持</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:450%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin-top:32px;margin-bottom:32px"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#71716b;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:left;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale">你收到这封邮件是因为你请求删除 Capy Notebook 账户。</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#71716b;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:left;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale"><a href="{{.UnsubscribeURL}}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" style="color:#5e5cdb;text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">管理产品邮件偏好</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>
